# c78l L3f: what timing would let ONE calibrated sensor + observer (3 taps T, T+10, T+20 on both edges) drive TP and L1/L2 together? M (in-plane (2,5)) and s lowered ideal and free; L3e.txt layout (no M chain in the top-left).
design designs/piston-door-3x3/tracks/s79/c78l/L3e.txt
let t = 11
let tc = 11
let mo = 15
let mc = 13
let ml = 10
let mlc = 10
let s2 = 17
